{"id":"d5d0908b482e31f2","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-dejongh-theorem.md","title":"De Jongh–Sambin Fixed-Point Property","display":"df-dejongh-theorem — De Jongh–Sambin Fixed-Point Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-dejongh-theorem","aliases":["89-df-dejongh-theorem"],"display":"df-dejongh-theorem — De Jongh–Sambin Fixed-Point Property","depends_on":["[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","[[89-df-modalized-formula]]","[[89-df-modal-equivalence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-dejongh-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-dejongh-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dejongh-theorem — De Jongh–Sambin Fixed-Point Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02536e2efd437c59\" href=\"?note=02536e2efd437c59\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point-modal\">89-df-fixed-point-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d8f6cb40eba269af\" href=\"?note=d8f6cb40eba269af\" title=\"89-df-modalized-formula\">89-df-modalized-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2112b0932fb2c41d\" href=\"?note=2112b0932fb2c41d\" title=\"89-df-modal-equivalence\">89-df-modal-equivalence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal M_{\\Box,p}\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal M_{\\Box,p}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\)</span> is the set of GL fixed points of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>\nin the variable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> is provable equivalence in GL.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DJ}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{DJ}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\)</span> 是下述定义的二元不动点存在及可证等价唯一性谓词，逻辑固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dejongh\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DJ}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\ \\land\\\n\\forall B,C\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\;\nB\\equiv_{\\mathrm{GL}}C\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dejongh\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DJ}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\ \\land\\\n\\forall B,C\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\;\nB\\equiv_{\\mathrm{GL}}C\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>De Jongh--Sambin 不动点定理断言：对每个关于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 模态化的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DJ}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{DJ}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\)</span> 成立；存在性之外，不动点还在 GL\n可证等价的意义下唯一。</li>\n<li>原文件把 Solovay 算术完备性的逆向蕴含误标为 De Jongh 定理；这里将\n该名称恢复为模态不动点性质。算术完备性由相应 Solovay 原子承担。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-fixed-point-modal","status":"resolved","id":"02536e2efd437c59","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modalized-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d8f6cb40eba269af","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modalized-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"2112b0932fb2c41d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-equivalence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal M_{\\Box,p}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DJ}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dejongh\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DJ}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\ \\land\\\n\\forall B,C\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\;\nB\\equiv_{\\mathrm{GL}}C\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DJ}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)","display":false}],"bytes":1428,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-4-axiom.md]]\n[[89-df-accessibility.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-realization.md]]\n[[89-df-bisimulation.md]]\n[[89-df-box-modality.md]]\n[[89-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[89-df-completeness-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[89-df-consistent-pa.md]]\n[[89-df-converse-well-founded.md]]\n[[89-df-dejongh-theorem.md]]\n[[89-df-diamond-modality.md]]\n[[89-df-filt